	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/interface_settings/campaign/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Every enemy squad in the campaign is two or three times as large, solo, split screen and co-op you host (on top of co-op's Extra Enemies). Legendary gets half as many extras. Starts with the next level; a saved game keeps its own."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Points for your kills in the campaign, solo, split screen and co-op you host: Tab shows each player's score and the team's, and each level ends with a summary and your best. Online: the host's choice."/>
		<string text="The small points that come up at the right of the screen as you score, such as +150 Triple Kill. Off hides them; Tab still shows the scores."/>
